  "name": "Barbarian audit: Powerful Grip, Ogre's Strength and Savage Strength are native stat auras (#1124, #1292, #2022)",
  "contract": "All three passives need no script. #1124 Powerful Grip (804728) effect 0 is SPELL_AURA_MECHANIC_DURATION_MOD (232, EffectBasePoints -31 DieSides 1 = -30, MiscValue 3 = Disarm); it is HandleNoImmediateEffect, consumed generically by Unit::CalculateSpellDuration, so there is no direct duration-reduction metric and only the aura_amount is asserted. Effect 1 is a plain SPELL_AURA_MOD_STAT (29, EffectBasePoints 24 DieSides 1 = 25, MiscValue 0 = Strength), a flat +25 read directly by the stat metric. #1292 Ogre's Strength (561160) effect 0 is SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_STAT_PERCENTAGE (137, amount 25, MiscValue 0 = Strength); effect 1 is SPELL_AURA_MOD_ATTACK_POWER_OF_STAT_PERCENT (268) but its EffectBasePoints is -1 DieSides 1, which CalcValue resolves to exactly 0 (the tooltip 'Increases your Strength by $s1%.' only ever references effect 0), so effect 1 is an inert leftover DBC row and is only asserted to still be 0, not exercised functionally. #2022 Savage Strength rank 1 (560886, amount 5) and rank 2 (561323, amount 10) are both SPELL_AURA_MOD_TOTAL_STAT_PERCENTAGE on MiscValue 1 = Agility. AuraEffect::HandleModTotalPercentStat/HandleModPercentStat-family handlers call ApplyPercentModFloatVar on the stat, which the stat metric reads back directly, so the ratio bands below are the exact percentages widened for integer stat rounding.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "b",
      "race": 1,
      "class": 12,
      "level": 80
    }
  ],
  "steps": [
